        "disabled": false,
        "info": "Reads Battery SOC State from registers:\n- 214: Battery 1 capacity %\n- 245: Battery 2 capacity %\n\nTriggers:\n1. Periodic: Every 5 minutes\n2. RPC: getBatterySocState"
